      "topic": "Lidocaine Maximum Dose Framing",
      "detail": "FDA/BNF guidelines allow 4.4 mg/kg plain (max 300 mg) and 7 mg/kg with adrenaline (max 500 mg). Traditional dental schools teach a flat 4.4 mg/kg (300 mg) cap even with vasoconstrictor. Indian recalls expect 4.4 without / 7 with adrenaline."
    },
